    "note": "YouTube 21.45.4 (YTKACE 1.1.5) - Native Liquid Glass rolling out!\n\nAdded Tweaks:\nYTABConfig, YTweaks, YouPIP, VolumeBoostYT, DontEatMyContent, ReturnYouTubeDislike, LowContrastMode, VideoOverlay, YouGetCaption, YouQuality, YouChooseQuality, YTHoldForSpeed, YouGroupSettings\n\nYTKACE settings (Enable Liquid Glass):\n1. Go to YTKACE Settings\n2. Tap Liquid Glass\n3. Tap Tab Bar\n4. Select YouTube on the list\n5. Restart YouTube\n\nCredits:\nYTKACE 1.1.5 by @itzzace0",
