    "tweaker": "",
    "note": "Spotify 9.1.90 (Taurus 0.60.6)\n• Fork of Chroma.pw (GPL-3.0): ad blocking, offline listening, Premium settings\n• Liquid Glass builds\n• Patched: for Feather + paid certificate\n• No Plugins: for SideStore/AltStore/Sideloadly\n\nSetup:\n1. Open Spotify \u003e profile picture \u003e Taurus Settings\n2. Premium, ads \u0026 privacy\n3. Toggle ON: Hide ads, Hide upsells, Spoof Premium\n4. Restart Spotify\n\nDownload songs:\n1. Tap Download on a song. If it doesn't work, hold the Home tab bar \u003e Taurus settings\n2. Downloads \u003e Download current track\n3. A green 📥 icon appears when done\n\nCredit: Taurus by samj-exe (github.com/samj-exe/taurus), fork of Chroma.pw by skopevoj",
    "thumbnail": "/thumbnails/com.spotify.client.jpg",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-10"
